sections:

#### prop_section ####
kind: proposition
----
statement: Given two circles about the same center, to inscribe in the greater circle an equilateral polygon with an even number of sides which does not touch the lesser circle.
----
proof:

Let *ABCD* and *EFGH* be the two given circles about the same center *K.*

It is required to inscribe in the greater circle *ABCD* an equilateral polygon with an even number of sides which does not touch the circle *EFGH.*

<figure class="diagram">
<canvas id="canvas_0" width="280" height="280" tabindex="0"></canvas>
